[{"title":"春日熊雪堂少宰以和黄山谷梅花韵见投同梅君作","author":"朱中楣","text":"几年偕隐同归洛，纷纷世态春冰薄。\n今古长安似弈棋，惟有投閒是先著。\n每思登眺帝子楼，风雨靡靡滞城郭。\n荒园颓倚杏花村，社鼓频传慰恬漠。\n时吟佳句响琳琅，满纸烟霞真骇愕。\n续貂髡颖韵难成，欲附青云为寄托。\n绿波隐隐泛兰舟，红蓼森森羡华萼。\n隋堤旧院冷秋千，谯国新旗缀珠珞。\n海棠无力怯春寒，梦破春愁愁满橐。\n融和天气正芳菲，芸窗课子差足乐。\n无燕翻飞堕碧空，流莺宛转惊铃索。\n屈指韶光又一年，閒看花开渐花落。\n不关春色苦相催，但恨封姨还肆虐。\n澹宕轻阴润杂弦，良宵煮茗奴称酪。\n却为听诗减夜眠，举案呼尊共微酌。\n寄语猿鹤莫漫猜，而今始践山林约。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25894,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅兴","author":"朱中楣","text":"身世苍茫里，烽烟已数千。\n旅愁春候觉，归梦草堂前。\n花径迷蝴蝶，家山映杜鹃。\n枝头闻鸟语，犹自说燕然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25895,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日感怀","author":"朱中楣","text":"青春作伴已还乡，赢得新诗富草堂。\n苏圃漫添湖水绿，柴桑难问径花黄。\n荒城处处伤离黍，旧燕飞飞觅画梁。\n家国可堪寥落甚，怡情何地足沧浪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25896,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟行晚眺","author":"朱中楣","text":"远望清流曲曲通，孤帆幸逐芰荷风。\n黑云片片归前浦，紫燕纷纷掠短篷。\n岸柳乍摇新水绿，山花遥带夕阳红。\n频闻箫鼓知村近，雨过潮平月正中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25897,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"岁杪答梅君维扬","author":"朱中楣","text":"久阅关乡未忍离，霏霏应值到家时。\n梅开芳信书凭早，梦绕江干月上迟。\n彭泽喜裁归去赋，芜城愁和寄来诗。\n新篘正熟思君赏，独坐深宵且课儿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25898,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟次清源和梅公韵","author":"朱中楣","text":"南归欲觅旧柴门，何意弹冠赴特恩。\n三径未成重理楫，千山遥忆隔啼猿。\n香侵蓼国飘红粉，露滴荷房泻绿尊。\n远岸菁葱连雨足，閒鸥飞泛点秋痕。\n朝廷有道思良弼，彤管承家愧昔媛。\n新月含辉云外吐，斜峰倒影浪中翻。\n偶来坠叶惊诗思，厌听严更搅梦烦。\n晚泊村宵难喔喔，平原戌猎鹿奔奔。\n天涯篷转随征雁，泽畔桑深卧野豚。\n银汉乍回青鹊羽，金风渐返木樨魂。\n知君自为苍生出，从古惟闻绮皓存。\n把酒漫同儿女醉，频年忧患不须论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25899,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚秋怀里","author":"朱中楣","text":"落叶惊残梦，秋归人未归。\n水明天一色，鸦带晚霜飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25900,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟泊鸠兹","author":"朱中楣","text":"水阔春回接楚湘，学啼娇鸟未调簧。\n起来卷幔窥红色，一抹青山带夕阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25901,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻子规","author":"朱中楣","text":"忽听啼鹃柳外飞，声声相唤不如归。\n人归何似春归易，芳草萋萋送落晖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25902,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宗伯年嫂招集沧浪亭观女郎演秣陵春","author":"朱中楣","text":"越调吴歈可并论，梅村翻入莫愁村。\n兴亡瞬息成今古，谁吊荒陵过白门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25903,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"邯郸才人嫁为厮养卒妇","author":"商景徽","text":"妾自承恩初，同心绾双结。\n灿烂若明霞，流霞不能涅。\n晨眺漳河流，夜卧丛台月。\n岂知中道乖，蛾眉坐沦没。\n春风伴赭衣，秋霞改玄发。\n镜台宝髻疏，罗裳暗香歇。\n愿作巫山云，朝朝反宫阙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25904,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"美女篇","author":"商景徽","text":"美女东城隅，红颜华灼灼。\n垂垂十二鬟，一一飞金雀。\n初日照楼台，春游出宛洛。\n采桑攀远杨，搴芳捋丛薄。\n行路何踟蹰，中心谅有托。\n不知谁家子，白马黄金络。\n强言立道傍，翩然互酬酢。\n本非淇上姝，宁践桑中约。\n家无薄幸儿，白头负前诺。\n赠妾双明珠，还君抵飞鹊。\n日暮行归来，空闺守寂寞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25905,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌 其一","author":"商景徽","text":"蜡烛照空帷，春宵难达曙。\n袷衣不著绵，预识中无絮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25906,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌 其二","author":"商景徽","text":"弄水恐湔裙，采莲畏伤手。\n花欹半面妆，愿得花间藕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25907,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌 其三","author":"商景徽","text":"栖鸟夜不眠，肃肃翻金井。\n五更霜月昏，不见双桐影。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25908,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌 其四","author":"商景徽","text":"五彩织薰笼，炉灰皎如雪。\n不弃炙残香，为爱心中热。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25909,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读毛西河濑中集作 其一","author":"商景徽","text":"芙蓉露下小池秋，金鸭烟消宿雨收。\n为读西河新句好，都梁艾蒳满妆楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25910,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读毛西河濑中集作 其二","author":"商景徽","text":"彩笔翩翩映玉台，频将绣帙向风开。\n可怜杜甫惊人句，不数陈留旷世才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25911,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊张曼殊 其一","author":"商景徽","text":"觅得温柔在帝乡，娇花容易萎严霜。\n丰台自此游人绝，芍药将开尽断肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25912,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊张曼殊 其二","author":"商景徽","text":"云髻峨峨似洛神，都人争学百环新。\n凭他学尽新妆巧，不是才郎收泪人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25913,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送黄皆令","author":"祁德渊","text":"西风江上雁初鸣，水落寒塘一棹轻。\n绕径黄花归故里，满堤红叶送秋声。\n片帆南浦离愁结，古道河梁别思生。\n此去长涂霜露肃，何时双鲤报柴荆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25914,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送别黄皆令","author":"祁德琼","text":"万山寒秋月，一苇寒秋波。\n美人理远棹，秋色低星河。\n送君青雀舫，赠君金叵罗。\n别路不辞远，别酒不辞多。\n良辰惜分袂，分袂当奈何。\n虽有千金装，何如《五噫歌》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25915,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和黄皆令游密园","author":"祁德琼","text":"朔气晴开万户烟，寒林落日点红泉。\n十年往事悲星散，千里交情共月圆。\n松径犹能邀令客，桃源应信有群仙。\n搴芳踏尽池塘路，泥印莲花步步妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25916,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明月","author":"祁德琼","text":"明月当空照，长河万里秋。\n井梧千叶尽，篱菊一樽幽。\n雁度云间影，猿啼岭上愁。\n萧萧玉佩冷，对景怯登楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25917,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寓山看梅","author":"祁德琼","text":"楼敞云阴薄，伤心花外来。\n风和新柳出，云尽老梅开。\n香气迎妆粉，春光照径苔。\n贪看千片玉，日暮尚徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25918,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"祁德琼","text":"坐久明镫乱，寒风入彩帏。\n阑干七十二，何处笛声飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25919,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采菱和黄皆令","author":"祁德琼","text":"采菱歌逐绿云飞，画舫轻随暮色归。\n枫叶两堤摇碧水，湖光一带入罗衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25920,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古意","author":"祁德茝","text":"惜昔与君别，杨柳丝堪结。\n芳草积如烟，飞花乱成雪。\n数载客京华，念君远别家。\n欲知遥塞雪，但看故园花。\n芳时处幽独，蜘蛛网金屋。\n细雨昨夜零，春苔上阶绿。\n对镜厌孤鸾，凌云怨黄鹄。\n憔悴玉台人，肠断珠帘曲。\n为欢须忆故，为衣莫道新。\n愿持江国月，流照苏门春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25921,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题钱舜举鸳鸯","author":"祁德茝","text":"柳丝织烟金缕细，绿波宛转通春意。\n锦塘一曲静沈沈，下有鸳鸯七十二。\n交颈双栖睡起迟，烟轻沙暖艳阳时。\n谁教钱选生香笔，画出多情崔珏诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25922,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送别黄皆令","author":"祁德茝","text":"画阁联吟恰一年，此时分袂两凄然。\n云间归雁路何处，林里飞花香可怜。\n远客青山皆别思，仙舟明月已无缘。\n怀君日后添离梦，寂寞荒村渡晚烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25923,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆益姊","author":"祁德茝","text":"拈来阁上黄金线，倚遍亭前白玉栏。\n徒忆空园悬画板，春风一夜杏花残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25924,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜花","author":"祁德茝","text":"花事阑珊又一年，当门岩壑总依然。\n落红满地休轻扫，也算留春在目前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25925,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋","author":"张德蕙","text":"秋气中天净，愁人独夜看。\n停桡江愈阔，却扇月初寒。\n霜入桐阴薄，风飘桂影残。\n扣舷情未已，露湿绮罗单。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25926,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠湘君","author":"张德蕙","text":"兰房独起迟，无语对罗帏。\n此意无人解，深闺未嫁时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25927,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游山","author":"朱德蓉","text":"寂寞佳山水，楼台薜荔间。\n野桥分竹路，高树绕溪湾。\n径曲留琴语，杯宽破客颜。\n夕阳钟磬外，犹有暮云閒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25928,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送别黄皆令","author":"朱德蓉","text":"青青杨柳枝，飘摇大道傍。\n大道多悲风，游子瞻故乡。\n执杯送行客，泪下沾衣裳。\n忆昔弭远棹，明月浮景光。\n杯觞极良宴，歌舞开华堂。\n好鸟得其侣，举翼双翱翔。\n胶漆两不解，金石安可方。\n分袂起仓猝，永夜生悲伤。\n吴山何渺渺，越水何茫茫。\n芙蓉凭秋波，熠耀吐幽香。\n采以奉所思，所思难可忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25929,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上巳","author":"朱德蓉","text":"桃花秋水湔春衣，旧日兰亭到亦稀。\n断岸羽觞晴日暖，远山横笛暮云飞。\n沙棠舟落江鸥起，玳瑁梁空澥燕归。\n尚有采蘩思未足，不堪月色上罗帏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25930,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采莲曲","author":"朱德蓉","text":"绿叶罗裙一色裁，芙蓉映水两边开。\n欲将新曲频频唱，恐有鸳鸯飞入来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25931,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏虞姬","author":"朱德蓉","text":"歌罢伤心泪几行，江山旋逐楚声亡。\n贞心甘向秋霜剑，不欲含情学汉妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25932,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"愁雨","author":"朱德蓉","text":"烟雨重重宿鸟惊，惜花愁听落花声。\n只今闺阁应寥寂，还忆亭台芳草生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25933,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄修嫣","author":"朱德蓉","text":"莫卷珠帘对碧山，山边孤鸟日飞还。\n如何百里相思路，惟有随人月影閒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25934,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"方维则","text":"小院何空寂，相依独此君。\n雪深愁易折，风急不堪闻。\n白石移花影，青苔拥籀文。\n楼头残月上，空翠落纷纷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25935,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采花蜂","author":"叶宝林","text":"遍采名园万树芳，春风鼓铸满篝粮。\n徒劳巧酝三冬计，讵料难留百叠房。\n甘苦不须重借问，难辛回忆倍堪伤。\n若还解得为谁语，随分安身是道场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25936,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"马上歌","author":"许氏","text":"快马轻刀夜斫营，健儿疾走夜无声。\n归来金镫齐敲响，不让须眉是此行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25937,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日漫兴","author":"徐璨","text":"帝苑芳春凤吹谐，看花曾遍洛阳街。\n行吟缓控青丝辔，击节频抽白玉钗。\n共挽鹿车归旧隐，几浮鱼艇散秋怀。\n霜风扫尽烟霞况，愁见龙城叶满阶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25938,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"陇头水","author":"徐璨","text":"西去穷荒恨，东看故国愁。\n一心悬两地，双泪落风流。\n羽檄秋偏急，戎车夜不休。\n壮夫轻出塞，未到陇山头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25939,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过莲池庵访圆明女师","author":"徐文琳","text":"精庐屈曲倚云根，松竹周遮不二门。\n顿使尘缘都洗涤，懒将世网一评论。\n山花径绕名难辨，斋磬声沈日又昏。\n小衲坛前閒指点，赐幡曾沐大君恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25940,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景","author":"纪映淮","text":"李花一孤村，流水数间屋。\n夕阳不见人，牯牛麦中宿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25941,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"桃叶歌","author":"纪映淮","text":"清溪有桃叶，流水载佳人。\n名以王郎久，花犹古渡新。\n楫摇秦代月，枝带晋时春。\n莫谓供凭览，因之可结邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25942,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日幽居","author":"纪映淮","text":"细竹深阴覆碧纱，石床书帙昼抛斜。\n半帘细润侵寒雨，一衲孤馨染落花。\n流水穿林寻野鹤，夕阳归树护栖鸦。\n春山淡漠无人共，遥倩诗囊贮乱霞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25943,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纪事","author":"毕著","text":"吾父矢报国，战死于蓟丘。\n父马为贼乘，父尸为贼收。\n父雠不能报，有愧秦女休。\n乘贼不及防，夜进千貔貅。\n杀贼血漉漉，手握雠人头。\n贼众自相杀，尸横满坑沟。\n父体舆榇归，薄葬荒山陬。\n相期智勇士，慨焉赋同仇。\n蛾贼一扫清，国家固金瓯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25944,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元宵喜晤十六侄如冈","author":"宫婉兰","text":"汝来恰值传柑节，我老惊看两鬓银。\n回首弟兄多隔别，相逢子侄独情亲。\n梅残正好迎新月，柳放何堪又暮春。\n带水家乡原不远，衰年惟有泪沾巾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25945,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海陵留别二嫂卞夫人","author":"宫婉兰","text":"数月相依情更深，殷勤棋局记知音。\n黄花绿酒难为别，万斛愁堆一寸心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25946,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"冒德娟","text":"閒步空阶有所思，无端新绿又盈枝。\n暮春天气人如醉，喜听莺声未老时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25947,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓起","author":"冒德娟","text":"晓来初起对窗纱，日上珠帘弄影斜。\n风动高枝黄鸟啭，声声啼向碧桃花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25948,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜","author":"冒德娟","text":"飘来红叶忽成秋，又见双星两地愁。\n阶下细虫喧不歇，檐前紫燕语难留。\n空庭砧杵催长夜，远寺钟鱼逼戍楼。\n薄醉欲眠犹未得，绮窗遥望月如钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25949,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日","author":"冒德娟","text":"芭蕉深绿映疏窗，高柳蝉鸣昼景长。\n闷卷珠帘看日影，鸳鸯相并立池塘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25950,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春闺","author":"冒德娟","text":"风动帘栊春昼长，莺声催起整残妆。\n独行亭畔拈花朵，不觉罗衣怯晚凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25951,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泊浦子口","author":"钱敬淑","text":"残年泊归棹，问酒郭西亭。\n雪圃芹芽白，江醪竹叶青。\n夕阳新别路，衰草古离情。\n隔岸寒山色，含凄望旧京。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25952,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日为两儿修读书船泊断桥作","author":"顾若璞","text":"闻道和熊阿母贤，翻来选胜断桥边。\n亭亭古树流疏月，漾漾轻袅泛碧烟。\n且自独居扬子宅，任他遥指米家船。\n高风还忆浮梅槛，短烛长吟理旧毡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25953,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮雨","author":"顾若璞","text":"涧草依依浮玉，堤杨拂拂迷烟。\n江上蒲帆欲没，村中桑女争还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25954,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和夫子西溪落梅","author":"顾若璞","text":"逦迤入西溪，溪深深几曲。\n断岸挂鱼罾，茅檐覆修竹。\n翠羽何啁啾，满林香扑簌。\n晴雪飞残英，坐爱倾蚁绿。\n鹿门迹未湮，与子同归宿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25955,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"捣衣篇","author":"顾若璞","text":"自惜盈盈十五馀，不施粉黛叹幽居。\n忽惊流浪双头鲤，带得交河一纸书。\n读书宛转愁不息，征人正在天山北。\n天山高插碍星流，漫驾红鸾过十洲。\n君挂雕弓控轻骑，妾闻胡雁怨高楼。\n满眼风光转眼歇，昨夜红颜换白发。\n捣衣声断咽霜风，掩袖啼多惨秋月。\n秋月孤帏漏正长，香奁宝箧耀华堂。\n鸣珰四面鸳鸯结，罗帐团回锦绣香。\n鸣珰罗帐芙蓉锦，华烛兰膏明未寝。\n解将珠镜光如刀，留待君来照鸳枕。\n饮尽金罍不见君，湘帘怨卧烟氤氲。\n羽书犹欲征边塞，愿逐巫山一片云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25956,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江上缫丝曲","author":"顾若璞","text":"桃花花繁杨柳垂，纤腰嫩脸香风吹。\n莺儿调声声正滑，堂上丝车鸣轧轧。\n少年骑马挟金弹，青幂朱舷纷夹岸。\n缫丝终日不忍看，寒螀早晚啼秋幔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25957,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自君之出矣 其一","author":"顾若璞","text":"自君之出矣，不理钗头玉。\n思君湘水深，啼痕犹在竹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25958,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自君之出矣 其二","author":"顾若璞","text":"自君之出矣，鸾镜不曾开。\n思君如璧月，皎皎照妆台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25959,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自君之出矣 其三","author":"顾若璞","text":"自君之出矣，罗幔月娟娟。\n思君如络纬，辗转一丝牵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25960,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"湖中","author":"顾若璞","text":"湖光渺渺冷烟微，江鹜沙凫伫不飞。\n恰欲抱琴轻别去，芰荷分绿上罗衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":25961,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]